(text "CURRENT POWER-ONLY DESIGN: USB data pins NC. <=500mA PSD design basis; COLD START NOT ACCEPTED (ISS max unknown)." (at 20.32 551.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "40854b6f-9d25-5989-b501-e09790dadcee"))
(text "Cap latch: PRE_N=!(VBUS_OK & AON_OK); CLR_N=AON_OK & (CAP_OK | VBUS_OK); RUN=Q & AON_OK." (at 20.32 556.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "4c11840c-d2ee-5342-82a8-c3f43d1c20da"))
(text "MODE=AON_RAW independent of RUN. U19 low-loss reverse barrier; U10 senses actual NORMAL_IN (no slow input RC)." (at 20.32 561.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "85bc04bb-acde-5f52-9272-6ac892187046"))
(text "SERVICE is distinct from ROM strap; MCU pin allocation lives in mcu-radio/. Power boundary numbers are not package pins." (at 20.32 566.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "1bb56f44-4a76-52cc-820c-da54b21ea98c"))
(text "MCU/RF and existing ISOW1412 sheet are explicit boundaries; no resident RDM loader, security/update code or PCB routing claimed." (at 20.32 571.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "ec7a687f-abe2-5da4-bd48-9fe2611e4e86"))
(text "15F at2.6V /25mA charge; runtime must subtract 100mV charge hysteresis. Stable source/PG still cannot promise future commit energy." (at 20.32 576.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "4d549f98-4666-5e36-8014-8c68fe3d3ca4"))
